  "description": "The amalgamation of two adjacent self-contained duplex flats (Flats 36 and 37) within a purpose-built residential building to form a single family dwelling (Use Class C3).\r\rThe works comprise internal reconfiguration to connect the two units at first floor level, with a secondary connection at ground floor level (subject to detailed design), creating a single dwelling across two levels. The development will rationalise the existing layouts, removing inefficient subdivision to provide a 3+ bedroom family home with improved circulation and living standards.\r\rNo external alterations are proposed. Existing entrances will be retained, and the works are limited to internal modifications within the building.",
